    "name": "Old Thiess: The Werewolf\u2019s Trial",
    "steam_appid": 3835500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/253d832b70135da824fd30fccdbc6527.poster.avif?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/253d832b70135da824fd30fccdbc6527.webm?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/253d832b70135da824fd30fccdbc6527.mp4?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a true story, Old Thiess: The Werewolf\u2019s Trial combines exploration, combat, and the intensity of a 2D platformer with the interactivity of a narrative game, where the player's actions shape the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/142a8edcb820a92edb9330b1b220faa3.webp?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on how well you perform, the villagers will either side with you or turn against you during the trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/bfbddb85cde4da7a8a7c8e0d0cfde991.webp?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tells the story of the trial of Old Thiess, a 17th-century Livonian peasant accused of being a werewolf by the Church and authorities. Through his testimony during the trial, relive his exploits in Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/8d5ec94f8d79117851b8e0a99b38515a.webp?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three circles of Hell inspired by Dante\u2019s <i>Divine Comedy</i>, each filled with unique landscapes, challenges, and encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/c6df4f43ddea8ea700f202da826f4845.poster.avif?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/c6df4f43ddea8ea700f202da826f4845.webm?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/c6df4f43ddea8ea700f202da826f4845.mp4?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/253d832b70135da824fd30fccdbc6527.poster.avif?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/253d832b70135da824fd30fccdbc6527.webm?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/253d832b70135da824fd30fccdbc6527.mp4?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a true story, Old Thiess: The Werewolf\u2019s Trial combines exploration, combat, and the intensity of a 2D platformer with the interactivity of a narrative game, where the player's actions shape the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/142a8edcb820a92edb9330b1b220faa3.webp?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on how well you perform, the villagers will either side with you or turn against you during the trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/bfbddb85cde4da7a8a7c8e0d0cfde991.webp?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tells the story of the trial of Old Thiess, a 17th-century Livonian peasant accused of being a werewolf by the Church and authorities. Through his testimony during the trial, relive his exploits in Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/8d5ec94f8d79117851b8e0a99b38515a.webp?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three circles of Hell inspired by Dante\u2019s <i>Divine Comedy</i>, each filled with unique landscapes, challenges, and encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/c6df4f43ddea8ea700f202da826f4845.poster.avif?t=1752497377\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/c6df4f43ddea8ea700f202da826f4845.webm?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835500/extras/c6df4f43ddea8ea700f202da826f4845.mp4?t=1752497377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by a historical event, relive the trial of Old Thiess, a 17th-century Livonian peasant accused of being a werewolf. Through his testimony, fight demons and witches in Hell to protect the villagers of J\u00fcrgensburg from a diabolical cult.",
